Set a selection then extend and trim both endpoints, exercising flsetselect's
overlapping-selection drawsel branches.

-- input --
growdata 0 0 the quick brown fox jumps over\n
setdot 0 5 10
setdot 0 3 15
setdot 0 6 9
-- waitframes --
56 62 68 76 84
-- drawops --
JIqbbAbddbbbbdbbbbdbbbYbilbbd{5}bbd{28}l{21}ddxddddxdxdxdxdx
